## [Items](items)

### [a Kralien route chart](clue_chart)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: ruins_find_chart, alien_1a
Sprite: pic:find_chart
---
A route chart, cut into a plate that has outlasted everyone who read it. It marks the relay
they ran to - and the way IN to it, which is not the way anything approaches from open
space.

### [deep salvage](ash_salvage)
---
Type: item/salvage
Art: ruins_find_ash_salvage, alien_1a
Price: 240
Sprite: pic:find_ash_salvage
---
Whatever they were mining here, they were mining it a long way down and they left in a
hurry. Eddy will ask where you got it.

### [a miner's tally](clue_tally)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: ruins_find_rod, alien_1a
Price: 40
Sprite: pic:find_rod
---
A notched stick from the tally-keeper's niche: days worked, loads out, and names crossed
off. The last notch is cut deeper than the rest.

## [Relics](relics)

### [The Ash Warren](ash_warren)
---
Atmosphere: red
Containment: tractor
Scrape band: 160
Margin: 90
Forbid jump: yes
Seed: 51
Art: plain_asteroid_6, plain_asteroid_9, plain_asteroid_10
